nalCharacterName":"賀茂 六花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ソーサリー」の才能がない勇次に代わり、後継ぎとして養女になった従妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭脳明晰、運動神経抜群、高い魔法素養を持ち、名家“賀茂家”の跡取りとしての気位が高く、負けず嫌い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"才能皆無の勇次を見下し、きつく当たることが多いが、幼い頃は、（「ソーサリー」以外）何でもできた勇次に密かに憧れていた様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"極度に緊張に弱く、そのせいで、トップの実力を持ちながら落ちこぼれクラスに入ることに……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「兄貴っ、な・に・を、そこでしてるのよ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"345","sourceWorkId":"10572","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来は従姉妹だが、勇次に才能が無いため養女になった義妹。学業抜群、運動神経抜群、さらに強大な【魔法使い】でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"賀茂家の跡取りとして非常に気位が高く、負けず嫌いで、努力家。勇次の代わりに跡継ぎとして育てられており、【ソーサリー】の才能が一切ない兄を見下し、きつく当たることが多い。が、小さい頃は、全て勇次に敵わず、密かに憧れが刷り込まれてしまっているような……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"秀才型で普段は冷静沈着、取り澄ましているが、一度発火すると猪突猛進、周囲が見えなくなる。ついでに緊張にえっらい弱く、すぐトイレに籠もってしまう悪癖も。そのおかげで、入学式早々からトラブルに巻き込まれ、トップ入学のはずがおちこぼれクラスに入る羽目に。しかも何故か勇次までもが一緒に……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法は、鬼や龍を呼び出し使役する強力な物であり、高い戦闘力を持っている。いつも賀茂家当主に累代仕えてきた式神クレハを付き従えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「兄貴っ、な・に・を、そこでしてるのよ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40299"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"345","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"345","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"345","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"345","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2176f342f797c8a21beb9723fdefd09aba723f26419b5d19f31745136c1ae0a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cbfa48e72440d16ac251698419871f2110383d5844fdf1f58f2488f503e561b1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"いのくちゆか","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:178133:40299:4490:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50083","characterName":"アルフヒルド・トレーネン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"40300","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"178133"}],"egsCharacterIds":["346"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50083"},"originalCharacterName":"アルフヒルド・トレーネン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"73"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"147"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"72"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"50"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園で、勇次が出会った不思議な少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"下品で暴力的、こらえ性がないなど、性格が悪く、たちも悪い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ワガママで感情表現がストレート。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"全力で喜び、全力で頑張り、全力で困って、全力で怒ると、いつでも全力全開。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強い「ソーサリー」を持つが、その生い立ちや家族などは、一切不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ええい、うるさいのじゃっ！　今は妾が喋っているのじゃっ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"346","sourceWorkId":"10572","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇次が【試しの門】学園で出会った不思議な少女。性格が悪い上にたちが悪く、我が儘で下品で暴力的、しかもこらえ性が無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その生い立ちや家族など全てが不明だが、何故か同じクラスに入ることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"六花に負けず劣らず我が儘で、感情表現がどれもストレートで激しい。全力で喜んで、全力で頑張って、全力で困って、全力で怒る。時折、寂しい表情を見せることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【ソーサリー】全般に巨大な力を振るうが、魔法は不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ええい、うるさいのじゃっ！今は妾が喋ってるのじゃっ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40300"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"73 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"346","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"147 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"346","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"72 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"346","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"50 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"346","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd90437a28cb7c8c6095bfb549ea2df426ffe06cf4b525613b5fd90619dd4e2b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a42995e2c4d7286c66bb26909907f263ab0c8ea6a95f74266b3cb88e2094ab64.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"成瀬未亜","creatorId":"vndb:s470","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s470","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s470","name":"成瀬 未亜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:178133:40300:4810:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50084","characterName":"風門院 薫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"40301","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"178133"}],"egsCharacterIds":["347"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50084"},"originalCharacterName":"風門院 薫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"77"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"六花をライバル視する、成金お嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エリートクラス在籍、生徒会所属と優秀な能力を持つが、自らの才能に溺れることなく、努力を惜しまない「ド根性」タイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「脱落者」として、六花を無視しようとしているようだが、その実、むちゃくちゃ意識しているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふん、どんなエリート様が来ると思ったら、賀茂家の質も落ちたもんだわ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"347","sourceWorkId":"10572","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"六花をライバル視している女の子。成金出身でかなりのお嬢様だが、歯を食いしばって頑張るど根性タイプ。六花を脱落者として無視しようとしているが、実は無茶苦茶意識している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エリートクラスな上に生徒会にも所属し、将来の生徒会会長を目指して、日夜奮闘している。些か、自分の胸にコンプレックスが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法は、風。強力な風を操り、自ら空を飛ぶことすら可能とする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふん、どんなエリート様が来ると思ったら、賀茂家の質も落ちたもんだわ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"40301"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"77 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"347","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"347","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"347","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"347","sourceWorkId":"10572","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/ter